{
  "id": 529,
  "title": "什么是数字孪生",
  "date": "2024-01-03",
  "summary": "目前，数字孪生已广泛应用于工业制造、智慧城市、智能交通、能源等主要行业。数字孪生作为虚拟仿真的重要领域，正以其强大的能力在各个行业创造前所未有的创新。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-529.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-12-22/20231222111438508.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section mpa-paragraph-type=\"ignored\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;color:;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:0.544px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:0px 8px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">近年来，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">这个词不断出现在公众视野中，尤其是随着物联网技术的发展，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">不断出现在各行各业。乍一看，这个概念还是比较生僻的。什么是</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">？</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">首先，我们来看一下数字孪生的定义，</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">“数字孪生应用白皮书”是这样说的：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">数字孪生是具有数据连接的特定物理实体或过程的数字化表达，该数据连接可以保证物理状态和虚拟状态之间的同速率收敛，并提供物理实体或流程过程的整个生命周期的集成视图，有助于优化整体性能</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">”</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">简单翻译一下，数字孪生就是在虚拟数字空间中映射现实世界中的事物，构建物理实体的</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">“数字克隆体”，实现对现实场景或对象的映射呈现、分析优化、诊断预测等。基于历史数据和实时数据。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">构建数字孪生的三个步骤</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">在阅读了大量的资料和资料后，对数字孪生的构建和应用进行了粗略的总结，可分为三个步骤：复制、构建和应用。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">复制：现实空间的数字化重建</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">首先，利用空间采集设备准确复制现实空间，通过物联网实现物理空间与数字空间的虚拟现实互动。在此过程中，将收集和传输结构数据、传感器数据、操作数据等与现实空间相关的数据。，为后期模型的构建和优化做准备。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">构建：数据驱动模型学习优化</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">当真实空间和物理实体被数字化复制时，相关数据已经上传到云端。数据清理处理后，可以结合处理后的数据，利用相关技术能力构建数字孪生模型，并不断验证和优化。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">应用：功能开发及实际应用</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">模型构建后，就是具体的应用。在这个阶段，具体的功能开发和应用将结合具体的应用场景和行业特点进行，如工厂车间的预测性维护、道路交通的模拟规划等。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">应用价值的数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">说到这里，数字孪生究竟有什么用呢？具体可应用于哪些场景或行业？下一步就一一回答。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">航空航天预测模拟</span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">航空航天作为科技的前沿应用领域，可以说是数字孪生技术应用最早的起源。在1969年美国阿波罗项目中，美国国家航空航天局（NASA）“物理双胞胎”是最早的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">技术的雏形，通过制造两个完全相同的航天器来形成。随着技术的迭代发展，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">技术广泛应用于航空航天产品的研发、故障检测和系统控制。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">工厂</span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">技术可以说是工业生产的宠儿，可以实现资源配置和智能生产，显著提高生产效率。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">工厂意味着将实体工厂转移到虚拟空间，实时获取工厂数据，实现对工厂的实时监控；同时，还可以模拟生产过程，优化生产过程；智能决策和预测分析也可以通过数据分析来支持</span>...可以说，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">技术在工业生产中非常有效。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">智能交通模拟</span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">数字孪生在智能交通行业的应用，主要是通过大数据分析、人工智能AI、交通模拟技术等方式，将实时收集的交通数据纳入建立的交通模型体系，实现真实路面交通与虚拟环境的深度融合，如车流变化模拟演绎或交通信号灯变化模拟，有助于更好地规划交通路线，为管理部门优化交通管理调度提供技术支持。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\">建设智慧城市</span>:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\">利用数字孪生技术，可以在虚拟网络空间中建设一个与物理世界相对应的孪生城市，通过数据全球识别、精准状态感知、实时数据分析等方式实现城市模拟、监控和控制，解决城市规划、设计、建设、管理和服务过程中的诸多问题。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">目前，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">已广泛应用于工业制造、智慧城市、智能交通、能源等主要行业。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">数字孪生</span><span style=\"font-family:arial;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px;background:#ffffff;font-family:arial;\">作为虚拟仿真的重要领域，正以其强大的能力在各个行业创造前所未有的创新。</span></p><br /></section></section>",
